  '第十八天|信息|radio': { example: 'The radio provides weather and traffic updates every hour.', translation: '收音机每小时提供天气和交通最新消息。', split: 'listen to the radio（听广播）；radio station（广播电台）' },
  '第十八天|信息|tape': { example: 'The teacher played an old language-learning tape in class.', translation: '老师在课堂上播放了一盘旧语言学习磁带。', split: 'cassette tape（盒式磁带）；tape recorder（磁带录音机）' },
  '第十八天|打电话|call': { example: 'Call the housing office if the heating stops working.', translation: '如果暖气停止工作，请给住房办公室打电话。', split: 'call someone（给某人打电话，前面不用 to）；call back（回电话）' },
  '第十八天|打电话|mobile phone': { example: 'Please switch off your mobile phone during the examination.', translation: '考试期间请关闭手机。', split: 'mobile phone 是英式常用说法；美式常用 cell phone' },
  '第十八天|打电话|phone': { example: 'I phoned the clinic to change my appointment.', translation: '我给诊所打电话更改预约。', split: 'phone 可作名词或动词；phone someone（给某人打电话）' },
  '第十八天|网络|internet': { example: 'Internet access is included in the monthly rent.', translation: '网络使用费包含在月租中。', split: 'Internet/internet（互联网）；internet access（网络连接）；on the internet' },
