  '第十天|带来带去|carry': { example: 'This bag is strong enough to carry several heavy books.', translation: '这个包足够结实，可以装并携带几本厚重的书。', split: 'carry（携带）→ carried（y 变 i）；carry a bag（提包）' },
  '第十天|带来带去|show': { example: 'Please show your booking confirmation at reception.', translation: '请在接待处出示预订确认单。', split: 'show someone something（给某人看某物）；show → showed → shown' },
